		(property "V2_part_selection" "Replaces original AA1608LCGSK with APT1608LZGCK. Green hue changes570→525nm; InGaN2mA type. Retain R14=3kohm: p.3typical graph implies roughly0.30mA/~15mcd at3.3V. Both LEDs require new symmetric manufacturer land:0.8×0.8mm pads at±0.825mm, cathode1/anode2, gap0.85mm. Original Footprint column is source provenance and MUST be replaced in the native candidate. Nominal height changes0.60→0.75mm; general±0.1mm means design bound0.85mm. Replace old AA1608model with manufacturer APT1608 STEP and verify registration/clearance. Stock/code research is not powered validation."
