		(property "Selection_note" "220uF, 25V, +/-20%, 600mArms at 100kHz; 390mArms at 120Hz from the 0.65 catalog factor; 160mOhm max ESR at 100kHz; 2000h at 105C; -55..105C; leakage55uA. D6.3 x H7.7mm nominal, H8.0mm maximum; base6.6+/-0.2mm. Pin1 positive, pin2 negative. Panasonic FT[HF] RDE0000C1269,1Sep2025,pp1-2; DME0000COL48,30Jan2026,p2 standardD8 lands: 3.2x1.6mm pads at +/-2.5mm,1.8mm gap, unchanged. Generic KiCad 3D model remains illustrative. Actual input ripple/transient/fit qualification remains open."
