		(property "V3_part_selection" "V3: Panasonic EEEFTE221XAL (supplier alias EEE-FTE221XAL), LCSC C1881633, replaces EEE-FTE221XAP with the FT halogen-free high-temperature-reflow configuration. Same 220uF/25V/20%, 600mArms at 100kHz, 160mOhm max ESR, D8 dimensions and standard lands. No capacitance, polarity, wiring, placement, copper, mask or paste geometry change. Live LCSC stock 56 on 2026-10-30; stock is not reserved and JLC order allocation must be checked."
